{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45307","headline":"妙喜寺逵公院赋得夜磬送吕评事 · 皎然","name":"妙喜寺逵公院赋得夜磬送吕评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一磬寒山至，凝心转清越。\n细和虚籁尽，疎绕悬泉发。\n在夜吟更长，停空韵难绝。\n幽僧悟深定，归客忘远别。\n寂历无性中，真声何起灭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}